sequenceDiagram
    actor L as Learner
    participant Q as QuizPage / QuizResult (React)
    participant API as quizApi (axios)
    participant QC as QuizController
    participant QS as QuizService
    participant DB as MySQL

    L->>Q: Open /quizzes/:id
    Q->>API: GET /api/v1/quizzes/{quizId}
    API->>QC: Bearer JWT
    QC->>QS: getQuizById
    QS->>DB: quiz + questions (answers stripped for LEARNER)
    DB-->>Q: questions without correct_option
    Q->>Q: start countdown timer (timeLimitMinutes)

    L->>Q: Answer questions, press Submit
    Q->>API: POST /api/v1/quizzes/{quizId}/attempts<br/>{"answers":[{questionId, selectedOption}]}
    API->>QC: 201 target
    QC->>QS: submitQuiz
    QS->>DB: load questions, compare selectedOption vs correct_option
    QS->>QS: score = earned/possible x 100, passed if >= passingScore
    QS->>DB: insert quiz_attempt + quiz_attempt_answers
    QS-->>Q: 201 ApiResponse QuizAttemptResponse
    Q->>Q: render QuizResult (score, percentage, pass, per-question review)
